{"id":"664933","name":"荔枝排骨","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/664933/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"排骨","amount":"适量"},{"name":"荔枝","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"生姜","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"排骨改刀切块。","img":"images/664933/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"排骨冷水下锅焯烫出血水后洗净。","img":"images/664933/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"生姜洗净切片备用。","img":"images/664933/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅中热油放入姜片炒香。","img":"images/664933/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入排骨翻炒。","img":"images/664933/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入适量老抽，蚝油，盐和白糖。","img":"images/664933/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"翻炒均匀上色入味。","img":"images/664933/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"炒过的排骨转入珐琅锅中，加入清水。","img":"images/664933/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"大火煮开盖上小火焖40分钟左右。","img":"images/664933/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"荔枝去壳去核洗净。","img":"images/664933/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"分钟左右后的排骨已经炖软烂。","img":"images/664933/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放入荔枝。","img":"images/664933/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"大火收汁大概5分钟左右即可。","img":"images/664933/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/664933/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/664933/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/664933/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}